cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MomentRT in research, please cite the software version used."
title: "MomentRT"
type: software
version: "0.12.1"
authors:
  - family-names: "Poinsinet de Sivry-Houle"
    given-names: "Martin"
abstract: >
  MomentRT is a Python library for deterministic light transport in
  scattering media. It provides analytical diffusion and finite-element P1,
  SP3, and P3 models, with tools for optical fields, contact detectors, and
  energy-balance diagnostics.
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - radiative transfer
  - light transport
  - scattering media
  - biomedical optics
  - tissue optics
  - diffusion approximation
  - spherical harmonics
  - finite element method
  - optical simulation
  - contact sensors
